; A plan that images objective0 with a camera calibrated for objective1.
;
; Valid under domains/v1-battery.pddl, because its `(calibrated ?c ?r)`
; predicate does not record *what* the camera was calibrated for.
; Rejected by domains/v2-calibration-fix.pddl, where the predicate carries
; the objective.
;
; No planner produced this. It was written to demonstrate that a model can
; accept a plan that the physical system it describes would not.
(navigate-bat rover0 waypoint3 waypoint1 bat0 b4 b4 b3)
(calibrate rover0 camera0 objective1 waypoint1)
(take_image rover0 waypoint1 objective0 camera0 high_res)
